set, #swapglides=0
Set, ((Opt=#OptDrw3SG)&(#drawernumber=3)&((#ExtraUnitText8 = "*under*")|(#ExtraUnitText8 = "*push*")|(#ExtraUnitText8 = "*inset*"))):#swapglides=1
Load, (#nodrawerbox=0)&(D3HG=0)&(D3H>0)&(D3T=3):E-Drawer Cost.Pcb

,Calculates a Drawer cost
